{
  "probability": 0.07,
  "range_low": 0.03,
  "range_high": 0.12,
  "summary": [
    "Current credible polling places CDU as the leading party in Baden-Württemberg, with Greens close behind and AfD well behind the top two.",
    "The strongest path for AfD to win the most seats would require late swings or district-level gains that flip direct-seat advantages, which are not clearly supported by the bulk of February 2026 polls.",
