        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "A smaller gap could, in principle, boost AfD via district-level gains if Greens underperform and CDU support does not proportionally translate into seat gains."
      },
      {
        "factor": "AfD gains against Greens in polls",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Some late snapshots show AfD approaching Greens; if persistent, this can raise the probability of AfD topping a seat tally under certain district outcomes."
      },
      {
        "factor": "District-level seat amplification under Baden-Württemberg's mixed-member system",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "weak",
