      },
      {
        "factor": "Turnout volatility among AfD supporters",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "weak",
        "rationale": "Uneven turnout could tilt results modestly in AfD's favor if its base mobilizes strongly on election day."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Baseline consensus from credible polls that AfD trails major rivals",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "A broad set of polls consistently places AfD behind CDU and/or Greens, anchoring the probability of leading in seats at a low level."
      }
    ],
    "synthesis_rationale": "Starting from a cautious anchor around 0.04, the factor updates introduce modest upward pressure from late-poll shifts and district-level dynamics but are outweighed by the strong, persistent CDU/Greens lead and the institutional barriers. Calibration folds in historical base rates and the 120-seat system, yielding a final calibrated probability near 0.07 with a broad uncertainty band to reflect potential tails."
